# UX workflow: copy and paste one Macro Destination with an explicit guard.
# Purpose: proves that the focused Destination context transports only CC,
# Paste appears only while pressed, an early armed release is non-mutating,
# and a full hold preserves the target Track channel and source curves.
# Whole-Slot copy/paste remains covered from Macro Performance.
# Expect: capture_match:source_destination=source_after_copy, capture_match:target_destination=target_after_cancel, capture_changed:target_destination=destination_pasted
# Expect: semantic:paste_pressed:effect=arm_paste_macro_destination, semantic:paste_pressed:outcome=pressed, semantic:paste_armed:outcome=armed, semantic:paste_cancelled:outcome=cancelled
# Expect: semantic:paste_armed_full:outcome=armed, semantic:destination_pasted:effect=paste_macro_destination, semantic:destination_pasted:outcome=applied, semantic:destination_pasted:target=macro_destination

0 scenario macro-auto-mod
80 capture screen source_grid

# Select the Macro structure context, then create Macro 2 through the normal
# add-slot grammar so Destination paste has a real, user-visible target and
# never creates a hidden Slot implicitly.
120 button NAV down
180 encoder NAV 1
240 button NAV up
360 encoder NAV 1
480 tap NAV 60

# Open Macro 1 on its Destination row. Automation and Modulation are visible
# but deliberately outside this clipboard payload.
700 button LEFT_BOTTOM down
780 tap MACRO_1 60
1760 tick
1820 button LEFT_BOTTOM up
2020 capture screen source_destination

# A tap copies. The resting strip deliberately remains Copy after the tap.
2170 tap BOTTOM_RIGHT 60
2370 capture screen source_after_copy

# Select Macro 2 as the exact Destination target with the active-Macro cycle.
2520 button LEFT_CENTER down
2680 encoder NAV 1
2840 button LEFT_CENTER up
3040 capture screen target_destination

# Press exposes Paste. Release after arming but before completion: no mutation.
3190 button BOTTOM_RIGHT down
3300 capture screen paste_pressed
3440 tick
3520 capture screen paste_armed
3590 button BOTTOM_RIGHT up
3770 capture screen paste_cancelled
4420 tick
4570 capture screen target_after_cancel

# A complete hold commits the CC once; release cannot replay the mutation.
4720 button BOTTOM_RIGHT down
4960 capture screen paste_armed_full
5780 tick
5840 button BOTTOM_RIGHT up
6090 capture screen destination_pasted
